  "title": "Angular Kinematic Equations Under Constant Angular Acceleration",
  "equation": "\\omega = \\omega_0 + \\alpha t, \\quad \\theta = \\omega_0 t + \\frac{1}{2} \\alpha t^2, \\quad \\omega^2 = \\omega_0^2 + 2 \\alpha \\theta",
